          "line": 42,
          "page": null,
          "excerpt": "Long-running agents build up long message histories, and Deep Agents handles this in two ways. Summarization condenses older messages once the context window fills up. Offloading catches large tool results and human messages before they reach the model, saves the full content to the filesystem, and leaves a short pointer in its place.",
